flowchart TD
  Start[POST /auth/login] --> Lock{Account locked?}
  Lock -->|yes| Locked[401 locked]
  Lock -->|no| Pwd{Password valid?}
  Pwd -->|no| BadCreds[401 invalid credentials]
  Pwd -->|yes| Confirmed{Email confirmed?}
  Confirmed -->|no| Confirm[401 EMAIL_NOT_CONFIRMED]
  Confirmed -->|yes| Totp{TOTP enrolled?}
  Totp -->|yes| TotpCode{code present?}
  TotpCode -->|no| ChallengeTotp[401 LOGIN_2FA_REQUIRED method totp]
  TotpCode -->|yes| VerifyTotp{TOTP valid?}
  VerifyTotp -->|no| InvalidTotp[401 LOGIN_2FA_INVALID method totp]
  VerifyTotp -->|yes| Jwt[200 JWT]
  Totp -->|no| Force{Force ON or email 2FA opted in?}
  Force -->|no| Jwt
  Force -->|yes| EmailCode{code present?}
  EmailCode -->|no| Send[Send login-2fa email]
  Send -->|ok| ChallengeEmail[401 LOGIN_2FA_REQUIRED method email]
  Send -->|fail| Unavailable[503 email unavailable]
  EmailCode -->|yes| VerifyEmail{Email OTP valid?}
  VerifyEmail -->|no| InvalidEmail[401 LOGIN_2FA_INVALID method email]
  VerifyEmail -->|yes| Jwt
